01:28:29,659 --> 01:28:35,119
 We provide up to 9,500 vacancies.

471
01:28:35,399 --> 01:28:40,779
 So all the government employees can also work with a sense of ease.

472
01:28:41,659 --> 01:28:43,119
 Thank you.

473
01:28:43,180 --> 01:28:49,119
 We would like to invite Ministry of Economic Affairs to answer the first and fourth question.

