01:30:23,520 --> 01:30:31,399
 to award companies that provide flexible working hours and family-friendly workplace.

487
01:30:31,399 --> 01:30:41,720
 And as of 2024, we have selected 13 friendly companies as role models for others to learn from.

488
01:30:42,560 --> 01:30:48,079
 So over these four years, we've noticed that most of the companies that were awarded,

489
01:30:48,159 --> 01:30:56,400
 about 80 percent of them, they demonstrated they have excellent performances

490
01:30:56,520 --> 01:31:05,300
 in terms of allowances for substantial allowance for childcare and flexible working hours

491
01:31:05,300 --> 01:31:12,760
 and flexible working modes, for example, working from home and including pick-up children.

