01:31:20,840 --> 01:31:25,000
 they can lessen one hour of their working hour per day.

494
01:31:25,000 --> 01:31:32,340
 These measures are substantially provided by the enterprises to the employees.

495
01:31:32,880 --> 01:31:48,340
 And in terms of narrowing the wage gap, we encourage enterprises to raise the salary for their workers.

496
01:31:48,340 --> 01:31:57,640
 And in 2024 August, we amended our SME Development Act in Article 36

497
01:31:57,640 --> 01:32:08,140
 when you are willing to raise the salary of the lower-level workers.

498
01:32:09,300 --> 01:32:16,239
 And you can effectively raise your profitability from 100 percent to 130 percent.

499
01:32:16,239 --> 01:32:27,720
 And that's a very good incentive to narrowing the wage gap and moda here regarding the digital forced labor.

