01:32:36,399 --> 01:32:43,920
 there is a guideline launched by the Ministry of Labor regarding forced labor prevention.

503
01:32:43,920 --> 01:32:54,140
 And even though digital tools can be used by employers to require of our workers,

504
01:32:54,359 --> 01:33:03,159
 but these digital tools are used for work assistance, not for forced labor.

505
01:33:03,640 --> 01:33:11,260
 We will continue to encourage the enterprises not to do so and to do outreach.

506
01:33:11,260 --> 01:33:14,899
 So these are the answers we have provided so far.

