01:34:59,119 --> 01:35:08,420
 They make up for 20% of our GDP, so we care very much about workplace equality,

523
01:35:08,600 --> 01:35:22,220
 and we have been holding awards for outstanding companies for over 10 years in 2024 in our evaluation indicators.

